Crusaders! 

A new patch 1.2.0 is out of beta and available for everyone now! If you participated in 1.2.0 beta, [b]please don’t forget to opt out[/b], because the [b]beta branch won’t get the update[/b]. And thank you for your participation!

[b]Highlights:[/b]

[list]
[*] We’ve fixed the Commander's tent on MacOS;
